    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "aaf2daf4fa72e824",
      "translationZh": "我目前正在考虑升级我的 5060ti 16gb。在 Qwen 3.8 IQ3_S HF 量化版本上，使用 130k 上下文时，我能达到约 40t/s。我在 linux 上运行 llama.cpp。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fc8c97b6946b1bf5",
      "translationZh": "目标是增加上下文长度、使用更好的量化版本，同时把 5060 腾出来用于其他任务。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c5cc1c7f49b01247",
      "translationZh": "我正在考虑的选项是 1x32GB V100 和 2x16GB V100。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f9e395c4f75ef46",
      "translationZh": "理论上，由于内存带宽更高，2x16GB 的性能应该优于 5060 和 1x32gb。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b248435790d01fa6",
      "translationZh": "我需要应对的一个问题是，CPU 到 GPU 的通信受限——我只有 2x x4 通道可用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ed8842ffd1ac8bd",
      "translationZh": "同一价位还有其他不错的选择吗？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "893ca1f1187a0954",
